     "<div style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><div style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:sans-serif;box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\">Hi,</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:sans-serif;box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\">I&#39;m trying to get a mappability wig file by running <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:1em;color:black;background:rgb(245,242,240);word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1.5;padding:0.1em;border-radius:0.3em\">generateMap.pl</span> from hmmcopy_utils. However, I&#39;m getting a message which states that,</p><blockquote style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:sans-serif;box-sizing:inherit;margin:1ex;border-left:2px dotted rgb(136,136,136);padding:1ex 1ex 1ex 5px;background:rgb(208,240,255)\"><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px;line-height:1.4285em\">Setting the index via positional argument will be deprecated in a future release. Please use -x option instead.</p></blockquote><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:sans-serif;box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\">What I did,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;overflow:auto;padding:1em;background:rgb(245,242,240);color:black;white-space:pre;word-break:normal;line-height:1.5;margin:0.5em 0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-size:1em;padding:0px;background:none;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1.5\">HMMCOPY_DIR<span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\">=</span>~/mysofts/hmmcopy_utils-master</span></span><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\"><span style=\"box-sizin