y/generateMap.pl  <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(238,153,0)\">${REF}</span>  -o <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(238,153,0)\">$index</span>/<a href=\"http://GRCh38_chr.fa.map.bw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://GRCh38_chr.fa.map.bw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235407739000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2f4HeH5KeIir-z3eKPrTKU\">GRCh38_chr.fa.map.bw</a>\r\n</span></span><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4285em\">I also tried using <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:1em;color:black;background:rgb(245,242,240);word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1.5;padding:0.1em;border-radius:0.3em\">-i</span> and <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:1em;color:black;background:rgb(245,242,240);word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1.5;padding:0.1em;border-radius:0.3em\">-x</span> for index files but not getting the desired output.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin:0px;line-height:1.4285em\">It will be a great help if someone please correct me.</p></div></span></div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;display:inline-block;padding-top:1em;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></span>"
